  "body": "### Checks\n\n- [x] I have updated to the lastest minor and patch version of Strands\n- [x] I have checked the documentation and this is not expected behavior\n- [x] I have searched [./issues](./issues?q=) and there are no duplicates of my issue\n\n### Strands Version\n\nlatest\n\n### Python Version\n\nlatest\n\n### Operating System\n\nmacos\n\n### Installation Method\n\npip\n\n### Steps to Reproduce\n\nStrands 1.36.0 still checks `reasoning_content`, while current vLLM 0.19.1 emits `delta.reasoning` and `message.reasoning`, so reasoning is dropped for OpenAI-compatible vLLM backends.\n\n### Expected Behavior\n\nsupport both old and new field names.\n\n### Actual Behavior\n\nonly supports `delta.reasoning_content` currently\n\n### Additional Context\n\n_No response_\n\n### Possible Solution\n\n_No response_\n\n### Related Issues\n\n_No response_",
